  ('CLM00000022', 'CN00003022', '2025-07-22T18:49:13.959000', 'SIU002', 'SPECIAL_INVESTIGATOR', 'SETTLEMENT_NEGOTIATION', 'Fraud indicators detected during routine review. Claimant provided inconsistent statements regarding vehicle location at time of theft. GPS records from connected car service show vehicle was at different location than reported. Referring to SIU for full investigation. Claim payment suspended pending outcome.', 'Fraud indicators detected - SIU referral', FALSE, NULL, 'Settlement: $6022; Payment Method: Direct Deposit', 'Settlement within guidelines; claimant satisfied'),
